      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "LeetCode is a platform that helps software engineers prepare for coding interviews. It offers a collection of practice coding problems\nfor users to solve and get feedback on their solutions. They also host competitions where users can compete to solve\nas many questions as possible in a set amount of time.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LeetCode is a platform that helps software engineers prepare for coding interviews. It offers a collection of practice coding problems\nfor users to solve and get feedback on their solutions. They also host competitions where users can compete to solve\nas many questions as possible in a set amount of time.",
