      "text": "// Get List of Problems\nGET /problems?page={1}&limit={100}\n- List<Problems>\n\n// Get Problem\nGET /problems/{problemid}\n-> problem\n\n// Submit Submission\nPOST /problems/{problemid}/submit\nheaders {JWTToken}\nbody {\n    code: {...}\n}\n-> Result {testcases: {}, pass/fail}\n\n// View Leaderboard\nGET /leaderboard?competition={id}&page={num}&limit={100}",
      "textAlign": "left",
